OL,3,GStrathclyde
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FLargely cloudy with rain at
OL,6,Ftimes, likely turning heavier and more
OL,7,Fpersistent later. Quite breezy around
OL,8,Fthe coasts. Best chance of any dry,
OL,9,Fbright weather towards the Isles.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FRemaining mostly cloudy with
OL,12,Ffurther rain at times, with just a few
OL,13,Fdrier clearer interludes in the far
OL,14,Fwest. Winds easing.
OL,15,
OL,16,CWednesday:FMainly cloudy with further
OL,17,Frain at times, though it will become
OL,18,Fdrier and perhaps a bit brighter later.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
